# .cursor/rules

## Shell command restrictions
- Never run rm -rf, sudo, curl, wget, or ssh commands without explicit confirmation
- Never run git push --force
- Never install packages (npm install, pip install) without showing me the list first
- Never modify dotfiles or files outside the current project directory

## File access restrictions  
- Do not read or modify .env, .env.*, or any file in secrets/
- Do not access ~/.ssh, ~/.zshrc, ~/.zprofile, or ~/.zsh_history
- Do not write to paths outside the current working directory

## Agent behaviour
- Always propose a plan and wait for my approval before multi-file edits
- Prefer minimal diffs — do not refactor unrelated code
- If a command might be destructive, ask before running it
